{"unit_id":"NanQing233__dsh-rimlight#card-zh","repo":"NanQing233/dsh-rimlight","commit":"40fc5077a3eebe43def093155a9b7c749b4c06b9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Rimlight（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为会话状态添加沿窗口圆角边缘流动的流星光带。它在客户端覆盖层绘制动画，并根据会话运行状态显示最多四条光带。主要功能包括等待回复时反向流动、按模型自动配色、可调拖尾与速度，以及会话结束时飞向界面目标后淡出。适合希望通过动态边缘效果辨认 DSH 会话状态并调整视觉风格的用户。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:680-720","index.js:17-30"]}
{"unit_id":"NanQing233__dsh-rimlight#card-en","repo":"NanQing233/dsh-rimlight","commit":"40fc5077a3eebe43def093155a9b7c749b4c06b9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Rimlight adds an animated edge light to DSH sessions. Up to four active sessions get bands that reverse while awaiting input, use model-based colors, and fade toward an interface target when complete. Users can adjust trail, speed, and glow. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:680-720","index.js:17-30"]}
