{"unit_id":"NanQing233__dsh-rimlight#feature-1","repo":"NanQing233/dsh-rimlight","commit":"40fc5077a3eebe43def093155a9b7c749b4c06b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Rimlight 的功能「会话边缘状态光带」：会话运行时沿客户端窗口边缘绘制流动光带；最多同时显示四条，对应活跃会话。相关行为由客户端组件处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:680-720"]}
{"unit_id":"NanQing233__dsh-rimlight#feature-2","repo":"NanQing233/dsh-rimlight","commit":"40fc5077a3eebe43def093155a9b7c749b4c06b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Rimlight 的功能「等待回复反向提示」：当会话处于等待用户输入状态时，光带可切换方向，作为需要回复的视觉提示。相关行为由客户端组件处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:694-705"]}
{"unit_id":"NanQing233__dsh-rimlight#feature-3","repo":"NanQing233/dsh-rimlight","commit":"40fc5077a3eebe43def093155a9b7c749b4c06b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Rimlight 的功能「按模型选择配色」：可按会话所用模型选择光带配色，并可配置是否启用自动配色及未知模型的默认主题。相关行为由客户端组件处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:21-23"]}
{"unit_id":"NanQing233__dsh-rimlight#feature-4","repo":"NanQing233/dsh-rimlight","commit":"40fc5077a3eebe43def093155a9b7c749b4c06b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Rimlight 的功能「自定义光带外观」：设置可调整拖尾长度、粗细、速度、扫掠幅度和边缘泛光，提供范围与默认值。相关行为由客户端组件处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18-30"]}
{"unit_id":"NanQing233__dsh-rimlight#feature-5","repo":"NanQing233/dsh-rimlight","commit":"40fc5077a3eebe43def093155a9b7c749b4c06b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Rimlight 的功能「会话结束动画」：会话结束时光带可沿路径飞向相应界面位置并淡出。相关行为由客户端组件处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1300-1364"]}
